  <section class="hero wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Docs · research brief</span><h1>GEO methodology — full brief</h1><p class="lede">Rendered from <code>docs/GEO_METHODOLOGY.md</code>. All sources accessed 2026-09-18.</p></section>
